*** Settings ***
Documentation       Generic checks in the browser - these keywords are used in tests.
...                 The selectors come from the page objects (resources/pages/).
Resource            ${EXECDIR}/resources/interactions/{{ 'browser' if web_library == 'browser' else 'selenium' }}_interactions.resource


*** Keywords ***
Element Should Be Shown
    [Documentation]    Checks that the element is visible.
    [Arguments]    ${selector}
    Wait For Visible Element    ${selector}

Element Should Show Text
    [Documentation]    Checks that the element shows exactly this text.
    [Arguments]    ${selector}    ${text}
    Wait For Text    ${selector}    ${text}

Element Text Should Include
    [Documentation]    Checks that the text of the element includes the expected part.
    [Arguments]    ${selector}    ${part}
    Wait For Text Part    ${selector}    ${part}

Number Of Elements Should Be
    [Documentation]    Checks how many elements match the selector.
    [Arguments]    ${selector}    ${count}
    Wait For Element Count    ${selector}    ${count}

Address Should Include
    [Documentation]    Checks that the address in the browser includes the part.
    [Arguments]    ${part}
    Wait For Address Part    ${part}
